{
 "version": 1,
 "doc": "ITR Showcase loot manifest (T-051). Custom loot tags with tiered budgets (never the vanilla zone tags, whose budgets are save-wide) and custom generator IDs. aiMod reads it at mod-map load and adds each tag to DA_GameConfig.LootArray (TMap add: key = tag, LootTable = the DataTable asset table_asset if the map pak includes it, else the DataTable of source_tag (shares used points with that zone!); LootPoints = loot_points). Regenerate with loot_manifest.py.",
 "budget_rule": "loot_points = max(1, round(source_zone_budget * scale)); source_zone_budget = sum of the source zone's area tags of that category (e.g. Buffer Ammo = BlockPost 24 + CarDepot 20 + TrainStation 32); scale = our tier footprint ha / source zone footprint ha (density-2.7.2.md). Stash.* tags are zone-wide in 2.7.2 and scale the same way.",
